OpenWings patch 0013: hard token and spend caps for agent runs

Upstream caps an agent run by rounds and tool calls only; it tracks
tokens and estimated cost for display but nothing stops on them.
OpenManus can stop on a token count (input tokens only, off by default).
OpenWings counts input and output tokens and dollars (the provider's reported
cost when it sends one, else upstream's price table), per run and per
person per day, for every model call; see wings/budget.py.

  * src/llm_core.py: stream_llm counts each streaming call when its stream
    ends; llm_call and llm_call_async count each provider answer. Every
    model call goes through one of these, so chat, agent rounds, the
    summaries after an agent loop, model calling tools, the non-streaming
    /api/chat route, deep research and helper calls are all counted.
  * src/clean_agent_preview.py: the compact agent runtime calls providers
    itself; its rounds and its scope classifier are counted the same way,
    and the caps are checked before each of its rounds.
  * src/agent_loop.py: a run starts its RunUsage before the compact branch;
    all calls made under the run's request (child runs, tools and a teacher
    run that takes over included) count toward it, and a run under a
    request already over its cap does not start. A person whose daily cap is used up gets a message
    instead of a run. Before any tool of a round runs, a run or daily cap
    that is reached stops the run through upstream's budget_exceeded path.
  * routes/chat_helpers.py: _enforce_chat_privileges refuses a new chat
    or agent message with 429 when the daily cap is used up (admins
    included), and charges the request's model calls to that person.
  * routes/chat_routes.py (/api/rewrite), routes/webhook/webhook_routes.py
    (/api/v1/chat): the same day cap check and owner.
  * routes/research/research_routes.py, src/task_scheduler.py: a research
    job (panel, agent tool or schedule) does not start when the person's
    daily cap is used up, and its calls count toward that person.
  * static/js/chat.js: budget_exceeded shows the message it carries.

All caps are off unless set in .env (WINGS_RUN_MAX_TOKENS,
WINGS_RUN_MAX_USD, WINGS_DAY_MAX_TOKENS, WINGS_DAY_MAX_USD).

Applies to: odysseus-dev/odysseus@9d0d3720f4ca181d87bef94da826d730acc6d483
License: AGPL-3.0-or-later (same as upstream)

